*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
# Non-secret environment config is tracked so a new engineer can run `terraform plan`.
# Anything holding credentials (secrets.*.tfvars) stays ignored above.
!infrastructure/terraform/environments/dev.tfvars
!infrastructure/terraform/environments/uat.tfvars
!infrastructure/terraform/environments/prod.tfvars
.terraform.lock.hcl

